  "details": "Right now, whenever an avatar enters a portal it just disappears. It would look better to have some kind of effect to indicate that the avatar has entered the portal.\n\nThe way I would do it is to take portal particles and create a small dissipation effect when the avatar unloads.\n\nIn addition, whenever a user enters a portal through the menu, it would look good if those same particles got pulled into the portal from the user's location .",
